\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Verification status of load-bearing claims. ``Method'' is the formal technique; ``Result'' is its outcome; ``Artifact'' names the public bundle file. A claim with both a formal artifact \emph  {and} a runtime conformance test is fully closed ({\textcolor {hhpatina}{\textbf  {\textsf  {closed}}}}); a claim with formal model but no deployed runtime is spec-only ({\textcolor {hhcinnabar}{\textbf  {\textsf  {spec-only}}}}); a claim with empirical evidence but no formal mechanization is partial ({\textcolor {hhbrass}{\textbf  {\textsf  {partial}}}}).}}{39}{table.caption.74}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:verification-status}{{5}{39}{Verification status of load-bearing claims. ``Method'' is the formal technique; ``Result'' is its outcome; ``Artifact'' names the public bundle file. A claim with both a formal artifact \emph {and} a runtime conformance test is fully closed (\Closed ); a claim with formal model but no deployed runtime is spec-only (\SpecOnly ); a claim with empirical evidence but no formal mechanization is partial (\Partial )}{table.caption.74}{}}
